# Nova Core V1 production freeze

AMICOR NOVA CORE V1 SOFTWARE BUILD FROZEN after Phase 6 (2026-09-09).

Do not change Nova Core V1 unless the user explicitly requests one of:

1. a verified production bug
2. a security issue
3. a data-integrity issue
4. a legal/compliance requirement
5. a launch-critical correction
6. explicitly authorized V2 work

See `docs/AMICOR_NOVA_CORE_V1_PRODUCTION_FREEZE.md`.

## Protected

- `/nova`, `/nova/workspace`, `/nova/communications`, `/nova/government`, `/nova/business`
- Mrs. Nova Brain display name and single-intelligence-layer design
- Trust labels: VERIFIED DATA, USER-SAVED INFORMATION, AI SUGGESTION
- Nova-owned Workspace, Communications, Government, and Business tables
- Organization and user isolation

## Still prohibited

- Accounting, general ledger, payroll, tax, 1099
- Autonomous outreach, autonomous calling, live government filing
- Stripe LIVE / real-money keys
- Hardware controls or physical Nova hardware
- Changes to frozen Freight, frozen Delivery, Driver 001, or Health lifecycle/billing/onboarding/`/workspace`
